aib9xxdJhrhWVC9qfzhxx8icHubsUVSk86kdEb9aQVnJ8c2xq6Vxh9qCFLx81TbvUeAml9RcGMG9utnpKMZMJnd6zqmiaqz0DNQAM6xBQ%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-19T09:44:22.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MjM5NDMwMTI2MA%3D%3D:2651704576:1","title":"电信光猫插件：能提取手机号、扫描内网","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5NDMwMTI2MA==&mid=2651704576&idx=1&sn=553f985fb888faa1216d5ed6abb5f687&chksm=bca43de95258c117ffe60c03ee6347723275b70046a28a3270e6dc5c4dbe2dfb16fc38a3aad1&scene=126&sessionid=1795146105#rd","description":"V2EX 网友分析了上海、浙江两台电信光猫里预装的 m01-b01-inner 插件，发现两个版本默认都会从明文 HTTP 请求中提取 IMEI，并定期上报联网设备清单。提取手机号的模块只在上海样本中发现。\n\n插件代码还包含远程执行命令和扫描内网端口的功能，其中端口扫描默认关闭。\n\n楼主分析时，两台光猫都已桥接并移除了远程管理通道，插件未能连上服务器，因此正常联网时实际上传了哪些数据，仍待抓包验证。\n\n/t/1257838","content":"<p>V2EX 网友分析了上海、浙江两台电信光猫里预装的 m01-b01-inner 插件，发现两个版本默认都会从明文 HTTP 请求中提取 IMEI，并定期上报联网设备清单。提取手机号的模块只在上海样本中发现。<br /><br />插件代码还包含远程执行命令和扫描内网端口的功能，其中端口扫描默认关闭。<br /><br />楼主分析时，两台光猫都已桥接并移除了远程管理通道，插件未能连上服务器，因此正常联网时实际上传了哪些数据，仍待抓包验证。<br /><br />/t/1257838</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxf0L1h5icwWBK6LymbuicAxnA2qWbHg2JUHQTuu0psEETOF9JMRIMdP0ia8xGC8icdhaVibo0WSJrP7gicYQurbeek28YH41l967PKvw%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxc6aoMgQOOs4Q8xwnlvoRSWLyciayv48PibgicyZrPsaXOIWLDiaCXvw0bbeEcd4ocVsUgHcGml4ZZqiaaP5wPWGqG825LlbakuXWuI%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxdY8wibgx0RXqg6PXcT1FdI6lNuAJSrxftFK3UMcZKabk5ib4LcvN9DEleWN8T86I8jJjKibHoZ3haqmuicOzrSLLae2TEW8rznNQM%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FTs4Edaib9xxe8ofcJYD1ibaex7puaiccokejJabbsoiaIicLxuHN34bXqlAQsGN6fsZUgER8GXmYiavUVZUAOLZggdZPPRCkX01MMF56TMmbps8QA%2F0\" style